{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02830","headline":"送幽州陈参军赴任寄呈乡曲父老 · 卢照邻","name":"送幽州陈参军赴任寄呈乡曲父老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓟北三千里，关西二十年。\n冯唐犹在汉，乐毅不归燕。\n人同黄鹤远，乡共白云连。\n郭隗池台处，昭王尊酒前。\n故人当已老，旧壑几成田。\n红颜如昨日，衰鬓似秋天。\n西蜀桥应毁，东周石尚全。\n灞池水犹绿，榆关月早圆。\n塞云初上雁，庭树欲销蝉。\n送君之旧国，挥泪独澘然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}